            "\n",
            "--- TRUTH TABLE ---\n",
            "===================================================================\n",
            "| P | Q | R | Q -> P | P -> ~Q | Q v R | KB | R | R -> P | Q -> R |\n",
            "===================================================================\n",
            "| F | F | F |   T  |    T   |   F   |  F | F |   T   |   T   |\n",
            "| F | F | T |   T  |    T   |   T   |  T | T |   F   |   T   | <-- KB is True\n",
            "| F | T | F |   F  |    T   |   T   |  F | F |   T   |   F   |\n",
            "| F | T | T |   F  |    T   |   T   |  F | T |   F   |   T   |\n",
            "| T | F | F |   T  |    T   |   F   |  F | F |   T   |   T   |\n",
            "| T | F | T |   T  |    T   |   T   |  T | T |   T   |   T   | <-- KB is True\n",
            "| T | T | F |   T  |    F   |   T   |  F | F |   T   |   F   |\n",
            "| T | T | T |   T  |    F   |   T   |  F | T |   T   |   T   |\n",
            "===================================================================\n",
            "\n",
            "i) Models in which KB is TRUE:\n",
            "   {'P': False, 'Q': False, 'R': True}\n",
            "   {'P': True, 'Q': False, 'R': True}\n",
            "\n",
            "--- ENTAILMENT RESULTS ---\n",
            "ii)  Does KB entail R?      : True\n",
            "iii) Does KB entail R -> P?  : False\n",
            "iv)  Does KB entail Q -> R?  : True\n"
          ]
